{"3954800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Campfire Harmony", "steam_appid": 3954800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break. Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1781911674\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lives on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transparent, resizable window you can place anywhere. Drag, resize, and let the fox keep you company over your work or study apps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.poster.avif?t=1781911674\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.webm?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.mp4?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decoration sets with small, satisfying bonuses, then add upgrades that keep the fire thriving. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quiet Progress, Warm Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft clinks and ember glow keep pace without pressure. No fail states, just cozy gains at your pace.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break. Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1781911674\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1781911674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lives on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transparent, resizable window you can place anywhere. Drag, resize, and let the fox keep you company over your work or study apps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.poster.avif?t=1781911674\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.